<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (3. Role of the Executive Board: The Executive Board is appointed to facilitate debate. The committee shall decide the direction and flow of debate. The delegates are the ones who constitute the committee and hence must be uninhibited while presenting their opinions/stance on any issue. However, the Executive Board may put forward questions and/or ask for clarifications at all points of time to further debate and test participants. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
